WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.427
A prime number has exactly two factors: one and itself. A composite number has more

00:00:05.427 --> 00:00:06.472
than two factors.

00:00:07.283 --> 00:00:13.214
Is 49 prime or composite? The answer is composite. 49 has more than two factors.

00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:19.402
A number card in a craft workshop contains 43. Which category describes it? Pause the

00:00:19.402 --> 00:00:20.476
video and think.

00:00:21.283 --> 00:00:26.529
A number card in a craft workshop contains 43. Which category describes it? The

00:00:26.529 --> 00:00:29.902
answer is prime. 43 has only 1 and itself.
